ust above the point $y=3$ points upward, and the arrow just below it points downward. In other words, both arrows point *away* from $y=3.$ This means that $y=3$ is a source.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and II only\"." 13194139534897 true] [17592186318143 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318144 13194139534897 true] [17592186318143 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318145 13194139534897 true] [17592186318143 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318146 13194139534897 true] [17592186318143 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318147 13194139534897 true] [17592186318143 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318148 13194139534897 true] [17592186318143 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534897 true] [17592186318143 1041 "selection" 13194139534897 true] [17592186318143 1104 #edb/ref 17592186318147 13194139534897 true] [17592186318143 1110 #uuid "1d5e56fd-d319-5cad-850c-36d9accff232" 13194139534897 true] [17592186318144 1034 "I and III only" 13194139534897 true] [17592186318144 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534897 true] [17592186318144 1111 #uuid "dbb76991-3ccc-5dad-ba2c-7057ef47f855" 13194139534897 true] [17592186318145 1034 "I only" 13194139534897 true] [17592186318145 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534897 true] [17592186318145 1111 #uuid "ce36ff0f-176d-566a-b1d3-bc3595494a00" 13194139534897 true] [17592186318146 1034 "III only" 13194139534897 true] [17592186318146 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534897 true] [17592186318146 1111 #uuid "8ad36393-ca24-55da-95b9-526ec97cbbf8" 13194139534897 true] [17592186318147 1034 "I and II only" 13194139534897 true] [17592186318147 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534897 true] [17592186318147 1111 #uuid "411b4708-72dc-5cb1-9178-e1e2bf8f8334" 13194139534897 true] [17592186318148 1034 "II only" 13194139534897 true] [17592186318148 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534897 true] [17592186318148 1111 #uuid "da2709e4-22eb-557f-975d-cf5045eac40d" 13194139534897 true] [17592186318149 1017 #edb/ref 17592186318150 13194139534897 true] [17592186318149 1089 "q-339707" 1319413953